  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Carreteras del Estado de Sao Paulo II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sao Paulo State Highways Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa de obras mltiples es mejorar el transporte terrestre de cargas y pasajeros en la Red Vial Estadual. Esta mejora se alcanzar rehabilitando tramos crticos de la red, disminuyendo los costos de transporte y aumentando la seguridad vial. La operacin mejorar la accesibilidad a mercados, contribuyendo con el aumento de la competitividad en el rea de influencia de los tramos intervenidos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program&apos;s general objective is to improve mobility, safety and accessibility for passengers and goods in the State Road Network (SRN). This improvement will be achieved by rehabilitating critical sections of the network, reducing transportation costs and increasing road safety. The operation will improve travel time and accessibility to markets and services boosting economic activities in its area of influence and contributing to the region&apos;s competitiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
